#: ../../../chemotools/adaptation/_x_axis_interpolator.py:docstring of
#: chemotools.adaptation._x_axis_interpolator.XAxisInterpolator:1
msgid "Interpolate every row of ``X`` onto a shared ``common_x_axis``."
msgstr "``X`` の各行を共通の ``common_x_axis`` 上へ補間します。"

#: ../../../chemotools/adaptation/_x_axis_interpolator.py:docstring of
#: chemotools.adaptation._x_axis_interpolator.XAxisInterpolator:3
msgid ""
"The transformer resamples each row of ``X`` from a sample-specific (or "
"shared) input grid ``x_axis`` onto a fixed ``common_x_axis`` provided at "
"instantiation time."
msgstr ""
"この Transformer は、``X`` の各行をサンプル固有（または共通）の入力グリッド "
"``x_axis`` から、インスタンス化時に指定した固定の ``common_x_axis`` へリサン"
"プリングします。"

#: ../../../chemotools/adaptation/_x_axis_interpolator.py:docstring of
#: chemotools.adaptation._x_axis_interpolator.XAxisInterpolator:7
msgid ""
"``x_axis`` is consumed as **metadata** so it can flow through ``Pipeline``, "
"``ColumnTransformer``, ``GridSearchCV``, and ``cross_validate`` once "
"metadata routing is enabled via:"
msgstr ""
"``x_axis`` は **メタデータ** として受け取られるため、次の設定でメタデータルー"
"ティングを有効にすると、``Pipeline``、``ColumnTransformer``、"
"``GridSearchCV``、``cross_validate`` を通じて渡されます。"

#: ../../../chemotools/adaptation/_x_axis_interpolator.py:docstring of
#: chemotools.adaptation._x_axis_interpolator.XAxisInterpolator:11
msgid "``sklearn.set_config(enable_metadata_routing=True)``."
msgstr "``sklearn.set_config(enable_metadata_routing=True)``."

#: ../../../chemotools/adaptation/_x_axis_interpolator.py:docstring of
#: chemotools.adaptation._x_axis_interpolator.XAxisInterpolator:13
msgid ""
"Before passing ``x_axis`` to a routed ``fit`` or ``fit_transform`` call, "
"configure both ``set_fit_request(x_axis=True)`` and "
"``set_transform_request(x_axis=True)``. For a routed ``transform`` call, "
"only the transform request is needed. Direct method calls do not require "
"request configuration."
msgstr ""
"ルーティングされた ``fit`` または ``fit_transform`` 呼び出しに ``x_axis`` "
"を渡す前に、``set_fit_request(x_axis=True)`` と "
"``set_transform_request(x_axis=True)`` の両方を設定してください。ルーティング"
"された ``transform`` 呼び出しでは、transform のリクエストのみが必要です。メ"
"ソッドを直接呼び出す場合、リクエストの設定は不要です。"

#: ../../source/methods/generated/chemotools.adaptation.XAxisInterpolator.rst:0
msgid "Parameters"
msgstr "パラメータ"

#: ../../../chemotools/adaptation/_x_axis_interpolator.py:docstring of
#: chemotools.adaptation._x_axis_interpolator.XAxisInterpolator:19
msgid ""
"Strictly increasing target grid. ``transform`` returns an array with "
"``n_output_features`` columns."
msgstr ""
"狭義単調増加するターゲットグリッド。``transform`` は ``n_output_features`` 列"
"の配列を返します。"

#: ../../../chemotools/adaptation/_x_axis_interpolator.py:docstring of
#: chemotools.adaptation._x_axis_interpolator.XAxisInterpolator:22
msgid ""
"The interpolation mode. One of: ``\"linear\"``, ``\"cubic\"`` or "
"``\"pchip\"``."
msgstr "補間モード。``\"linear\"``、``\"cubic\"``、``\"pchip\"`` のいずれか。"

#: ../../../chemotools/adaptation/_x_axis_interpolator.py:docstring of
#: chemotools.adaptation._x_axis_interpolator.XAxisInterpolator:25
msgid ""
"Value returned for query points below the input grid (passed "
"to :func:`numpy.interp`)."
msgstr ""
"入力グリッドより小さいクエリ点に対して返す値（:func:`numpy.interp` に渡されま"
"す）。"

#: ../../../chemotools/adaptation/_x_axis_interpolator.py:docstring of
#: chemotools.adaptation._x_axis_interpolator.XAxisInterpolator:28
msgid "Value returned for query points above the input grid."
msgstr "入力グリッドより大きいクエリ点に対して返す値。"

#: ../../../chemotools/adaptation/_x_axis_interpolator.py:docstring of
#: chemotools.adaptation._x_axis_interpolator.XAxisInterpolator:30
msgid ""
"Number of parallel jobs used to process sample rows independently "
"during :meth:`transform`. Use ``1`` for serial execution."
msgstr ""
":meth:`transform` 時にサンプル行を個別に処理する並列ジョブ数。逐次実行には "
"``1`` を使用します。"

